te for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. \n\nDoes this affect new projects? Are the skeletons correct in dev3 based on the expected results? How does this relate to 4.5.1, is there equivalent functionality?\n\nIf this is a simple case of pre-dev3 being wrong I don't think there's anything to do here, unless the change also affects 4.5, adding \"compatibility\" for broken imports would be bloat I'd say, but if the error was present in 4.5 we might add code to make it fix things \"correctly\", but might not be possible ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490478786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490702818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112427#issuecomment-3490702818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112427","id":3490702818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QD-Xi","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github